## OWASP Agentic Top 10 (ASI) <-> MIT domain taxonomy
## No upstream SSSOM row exists for ASI; these are PAIR-AI curation. The
## ASI <-> OWASP LLM links live on the ASI entries themselves (skos:broadMatch),
## since OWASP frames each agentic entry as extending an LLM Top 10 entry.

# Acting on external systems through tools without mediation is an attack
# surface on the AI system itself (2-2) and removes the human from decisions
# the architecture still attributes to them (5-2).
asi:asi02-tool-misuse
    skos:relatedMatch mit:subdomain-2-2 ,
        mit:subdomain-5-2 .

# Poisoned retained context is an attack on the system (2-2) whose visible
# effect downstream is false or misleading output (3-1).
asi:asi06-memory-and-context-poisoning
    skos:relatedMatch mit:subdomain-2-2 ,
        mit:subdomain-3-1 .
